# counters on this artifact. It becomes a 0/0 Spirit creature in addition to its other types. Activate only once." (CR 602.5b,
# 122.1, 205.1b). Turn 1 three Moxen pay for it ({3}, the pool empty right after); the first ability gives {B} (green refused,
